{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "Voronoi 单元格拾取 + label 防重叠标签：cars 数据集的马力-油耗散点图",
  "width": 640,
  "height": 400,
  "padding": 8,

  "title": {
    "text": "汽车马力 vs 油耗：Voronoi 拾取与自动标签",
    "fontSize": 15
  },

  "signals": [
    {
      "name": "hovered",
      "value": null,
      "on": [
        { "events": "@cells:mouseover", "update": "datum" },
        { "events": "@cells:mouseout", "update": "null" }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "data": [
    {
      "name": "cars",
      "url": "../../assets/data/cars.json",
      "transform": [
        {
          "type": "filter",
          "expr": "datum.Horsepower != null && datum.Miles_per_Gallon != null"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "pts",
      "source": "cars",
      "transform": [
        { "type": "formula", "as": "px", "expr": "scale('x', datum.Horsepower)" },
        { "type": "formula", "as": "py", "expr": "scale('y', datum.Miles_per_Gallon)" },
        {
          "type": "voronoi",
          "x": "px",
          "y": "py",
          "extent": { "signal": "[[0, 0], [width, height]]" },
          "as": "cell"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "labelcars",
      "source": "pts",
      "comment": "每个产地取马力最高的 2 辆。分区参数名是 groupby（不是 partitionby —— window 变换没有这个参数，写错会被静默忽略、退化成全局排名）。用 row_number 而不是 rank：cars 里 USA 有三辆 225 马力的车并列，rank 会给并列行同一个名次，datum.rank <= 2 会一次放出 4 条。",
      "transform": [
        {
          "type": "window",
          "ops": ["row_number"],
          "as": ["rank"],
          "groupby": ["Origin"],
          "sort": { "field": "Horsepower", "order": "descending" }
        },
        { "type": "filter", "expr": "datum.rank <= 2" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hovercar",
      "source": "pts",
      "transform": [
        { "type": "filter", "expr": "datum === hovered" }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "scales": [
    {
      "name": "x",
      "type": "linear",
      "domain": { "data": "cars", "field": "Horsepower" },
      "range": "width",
      "nice": true,
      "zero": false
    },
    {
      "name": "y",
      "type": "linear",
      "domain": { "data": "cars", "field": "Miles_per_Gallon" },
      "range": "height",
      "nice": true,
      "zero": false
    },
    {
      "name": "c",
      "type": "ordinal",
      "domain": { "data": "cars", "field": "Origin" },
      "range": ["#4e79a7", "#f28e2b", "#59a14f"]
    }
  ],

  "axes": [
    { "orient": "bottom", "scale": "x", "title": "马力 Horsepower", "grid": true, "gridOpacity": 0.3 },
    { "orient": "left", "scale": "y", "title": "每加仑英里数 Miles_per_Gallon", "grid": true, "gridOpacity": 0.3 }
  ],

  "legends": [
    { "fill": "c", "orient": "top-right", "title": "产地 Origin" }
  ],

  "marks": [
    {
      "name": "points",
      "type": "symbol",
      "from": { "data": "pts" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "x": { "field": "px" },
          "y": { "field": "py" },
          "fill": { "scale": "c", "field": "Origin" }
        },
        "update": {
          "size": { "signal": "datum === hovered ? 300 : 60" },
          "fillOpacity": { "signal": "hovered == null || datum === hovered ? 0.75 : 0.2" },
          "stroke": { "signal": "datum === hovered ? '#333333' : '#ffffff'" },
          "strokeWidth": { "signal": "datum === hovered ? 2 : 0.5" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "labelpoints",
      "type": "symbol",
      "from": { "data": "labelcars" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "x": { "field": "px" },
          "y": { "field": "py" },
          "size": { "value": 220 },
          "fillOpacity": { "value": 0 },
          "stroke": { "value": "#e45756" },
          "strokeWidth": { "value": 1.5 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "labels",
      "type": "text",
      "from": { "data": "labelpoints" },
      "comment": "anchor 必须给足八个方位、offset 必须给一串递增值：实测只留上下左右时，单档 offset 4 只摆得下 2/6 条、换成这里的四档 offset 反而只剩 1/6 条，其余全被写成 opacity 0；补上四个斜方位才是 6/6。方位的先后顺序也会影响贪心结果，这里用的就是 label 变换的默认顺序。",
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "text": { "field": "datum.Name" },
          "fontSize": { "value": 10 },
          "fill": { "value": "#333333" }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "type": "label",
          "size": { "signal": "[width, height]" },
          "avoidMarks": ["points"],
          "anchor": [
            "top-left", "left", "bottom-left", "top",
            "bottom", "top-right", "right", "bottom-right"
          ],
          "offset": [5, 11, 18, 26]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hovernamehalo",
      "type": "text",
      "from": { "data": "hovercar" },
      "comment": "白色描边光环单独占一个 mark，必须画在 hovername 之前。Vega 的 text 渲染是先 fillText 再 strokeText，同一个 mark 上同时写 fill + 3px stroke 的话描边会把字身盖掉，出来是白底白字。",
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "x": { "field": "px" },
          "y": { "field": "py" },
          "dy": { "value": -14 },
          "text": { "field": "Name" },
          "align": { "value": "center" },
          "fontSize": { "value": 13 },
          "fontWeight": { "value": "bold" },
          "fill": { "value": null },
          "stroke": { "value": "#ffffff" },
          "strokeWidth": { "value": 3 },
          "strokeOpacity": { "value": 0.9 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hovername",
      "type": "text",
      "from": { "data": "hovercar" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "x": { "field": "px" },
          "y": { "field": "py" },
          "dy": { "value": -14 },
          "text": { "field": "Name" },
          "align": { "value": "center" },
          "fontSize": { "value": 13 },
          "fontWeight": { "value": "bold" },
          "fill": { "value": "#222222" }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "cells",
      "type": "path",
      "comment": "透明 Voronoi 拾取层必须是最后一个 mark：Vega 的命中测试按 mark 声明顺序逆序取第一个命中者，放在最前面会被上方的 points 抢走 pick，导致 @cells:mouseout 与 mouseover 反复互撞、高亮闪烁。",
      "from": { "data": "pts" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "path": { "field": "cell" },
          "fill": { "value": "transparent" }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
